    <div class=3D"s-prose js-post-body" itemprop=3D"text">
<p>You can do this with <code>pidwait</code>, albeit in a roundabout way. W=
orks for any target process, as far as I can tell. This here waits for the =
process of ID <code>12345</code> to finish:</p>
<pre class=3D"lang-bash s-code-block"><code data-highlighted=3D"yes" class=
=3D"hljs language-bash"><span class=3D"hljs-built_in">echo</span> 12345 | p=
idwait -F /dev/stdin
</code></pre>
    </div>
